# November 19, 2026: Rome and the north of Oneida County, region mohw (Mohawk Valley west), drawn at random by
# tools/choose.py --state ny, which offered Boonville, Palatine Bridge and Nelliston. The Atlas had one place within 20 km
# of Boonville (the Five Lock Combine) and nothing at all within 12 km of Rome.
# Towns: Rome (with the old Oneida Carry), Western (Westernville and drowned Delta), Floyd (Camroden), Steuben, Remsen,
# Trenton (Holland Patent, Wethersfield, Trenton Falls) and Boonville. Sources opened in this session: Wikipedia as raw text
# (tools/wiki_raw.py), HMdb marker pages (nearby lists round Rome, Delta, Boonville and Forestport), the Rome Historical
# Society, National Park Service and NY State Parks pages, the Black River Canal Museum's 2026 newsletter, Atlas Obscura,
# and radio-station news pages (bigfrog104.com, wibx950.com), all through tools/page.py. No National Register form could
# be read (NPGallery has only placeholders for these listings).
